@startuml
title Deployment + CI/CD (Docker -> Registry -> Kubernetes) - TARGET P3

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Developer" as Dev

component "Git Repository\n(GitHub/GitLab)" as Git
component "CI Pipeline\n(GitHub Actions)" as CI
component "Container Registry\n(Docker Hub/GHCR)" as Registry

package "Kubernetes Cluster" as K8S {
  component "Nginx Ingress" as Ingress

  package "Microservices (Deployments)" as MS {
    component "auth-service" as Auth
    component "clients-service" as Clients
    component "doctors-service" as Doctors
    component "appointments-service" as Appointments
    component "notes-service" as Notes
  }

  queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ

  database "PostgreSQL (Supabase)\n(auth)" as DBA
  database "PostgreSQL (Supabase)\n(appointments)" as DBP
  database "MongoDB\n(clients)" as DBC
  database "MongoDB\n(doctors)" as DBD
  database "MongoDB\n(notes)" as DBN

  component "Prometheus/Grafana/Jaeger/Loki\n(Observability)" as Obs
}

' Code flow
Dev --> Git : git push

Git --> CI : trigger pipeline
CI --> CI : build + unit tests\n+ (optional) contract tests (Pact)
CI --> CI : docker build images\n(tag semver/commit sha)
CI --> Registry : push images

' Deploy flow
CI --> K8S : kubectl apply / helm upgrade\n(update image tags)
K8S --> MS : rolling update OR blue-green/canary
Ingress --> MS : route traffic by paths

' Health / readiness gating
MS --> MS : liveness/readiness probes\n(Actuator endpoints)
Obs <-- MS : scrape metrics + collect logs/traces

' Data ownership
Auth --> DBA
Appointments --> DBP
Clients --> DBC
Doctors --> DBD
Notes --> DBN

' Messaging
Appointments --> MQ
MQ --> Notes

note right of MS
Zero-downtime:
- RollingUpdate (mínimo)
- ou Blue-Green/Canary (nota alta)
Gating via readinessProbe + métricas
end note

@enduml
